1
00:00:03,173 --> 00:00:06,379
Open Access Control, Roles, and edit a role.

2
00:00:06,379 --> 00:00:09,457
Search its permissions for custom reports.

3
00:00:09,457 --> 00:00:14,587
Build reports and manage own custom reports and views lets a person design

4
00:00:14,587 --> 00:00:18,243
reports and views, and change and delete their own.

5
00:00:18,695 --> 00:00:23,607
View all custom reports lets a person run every report, whoever owns it.

6
00:00:23,607 --> 00:00:28,772
Manage all custom reports and views lets them change and delete every report

7
00:00:28,772 --> 00:00:32,425
and view, and it includes the two permissions above.

8
00:00:32,876 --> 00:00:37,564
Share custom reports publicly and through share links is the one that lets

9
00:00:37,564 --> 00:00:42,136
a person share a report with the Anonymous role, and create share links.

10
00:00:42,595 --> 00:00:44,551
Search for report groups.

11
00:00:44,551 --> 00:00:51,049
Manage report groups lets a person create, change and delete the groups reports are listed under.

12
00:00:51,049 --> 00:00:54,455
Manage all custom reports and views includes it.

